// Two claims on case 0, differing in kind: the three claim columns are
// parallel and claim_conscase_fixture pushes only conscase, so conskind and
// consbound are empty under it and every function that compares them reads
// out of bounds. case_fidx_fixture supplies the two casefn rows carries and
// same_claim need to tell one function's cases from another's.
claim_cols_fixture() {
  case_fidx_fixture();
  push((import conscase), 0);
  claim_cols_rest();
} return void;
